  "body": "Brand New | Freehold | No Body Corporate Fees | 10-Year Halo Guarantee\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendor – All Reasonable Offers Considered!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 124 Arran Road, Browns Bay – an exciting collection of brand-new homes offering beautiful sea views, generous living spaces and an exceptional North Shore lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, a growing family, a downsizer or a property investor, there's a home here to suit your needs.\r\n\r\nTwo Spacious Layouts to Choose From:\r\n\r\n2-Bedroom Homes | 93sqm\r\n• Generous open-plan living and contemporary interiors\r\n• Beautiful sea views\r\n• Dedicated car park\r\n• Rental appraisal of $700–$730 per week\r\n\r\n3-Bedroom Homes | 137sqm\r\n• Spacious, family-friendly layouts\r\n• Beautiful sea views\r\n• Internal access garage\r\n• Rental appraisal of $820–$860 per week\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love These Homes:\r\n\r\n• Sea Views from Every Home – Enjoy beautiful coastal outlooks and a refreshing sense of openness.\r\n• Highly Sought-After School Zones – Including Rangitoto College, Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay Intermediate, offering excellent educational opportunities.\r\n• Spacious & Thoughtfully Designed – Generous floor areas, comfortable living spaces and modern finishes.\r\n• Freehold Titles & No Body Corporate Fees – Enjoy greater ownership independence without ongoing body corporate fees.\r\n• 10-Year Halo Guarantee – Added confidence and peace of mind.\r\n• Brand-New & Low Maintenance – Modern kitchens, quality appliances and stylish interiors.\r\n• Attractive Rental Potential – An appealing opportunity for homeowners and investors alike.\r\n• Fantastic Browns Bay Location – Close to beaches, cafés, shopping, schools and everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nYour New Home. Your Coastal Lifestyle. Your Opportunity.\r\n\r\nWith two spacious layouts, beautiful sea views and excellent school zones, these homes offer an outstanding opportunity to secure a brand-new property in a highly desirable North Shore location.\r\n\r\nThe Vendor Is Highly Motivated and Ready to Sell!\r\n\r\nAll reasonable offers will be seriously considered.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and discover which home is right for you!\r\n\r\nRental figures are appraisals only. Actual rental income may vary.",
